          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On June 7, 2013 at 1 a.m., a witness is intrigued by a fixed white light phenomenon in the sky. He describes a white glowing point with a horizontal glowing trail and below it a curved pink shape. No particular noise is heard. He makes the same observation the following night. The GEIPAN dispatched a person to observe the surroundings of the village at night in order to detect a possible fixed light, without success. Eventually, it was the witness himself, with a neighbor, who meticulously observed the phenomenon and noticed it was a reflection of public lighting on an antenna. See the photos: one rather dark (6730) corresponds roughly to what the witness saw with the naked eye, and the other (6738), with a longer exposure, reveals the origin of the phenomenon. This peculiar case is therefore classified \"A\" as perfectly identified.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "f13702dabb677fcf0a7b81d5e927d22eb518f63132a7d4864eeb1340bed1465d"
        }
